  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0}\\left\\{\\frac{\\sqrt{1+x}}{x}-\\sqrt{1+\\frac{1}{x^{2}}}\\right\\}$\r\n$=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0}\\left\\{\\frac{\\sqrt{1+x}-\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}{x}\\right\\}\\left(\\frac{0}{0}\\right.$ form $)$\r\n$=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{\\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{1+x}}-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}}{1}$ (Use L-Hospital Rule)\r\n$=\\frac{1}{2 \\sqrt{1+0}}-0=\\frac{1}{2}$",
    "image": null
  },
